00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:04.820
When working with documents, there may
be occasions where you need to protect

00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:08.940
the document which will restrict access
or editing rights to the document.

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:12.840
As you can see, I have a demonstration
document on the screen in front of

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:16.260
me, and I'm going to demonstrate how
you can apply a password to access

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:20.820
the file, and also a password to
restrict any editing of the document.

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:24.810
The first thing I need to do is
I need to navigate up to the top

00:00:24.810 --> 00:00:27.510
toolbar and select the tools option.

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:31.169
And then, from the drop down,
the protect document option.

00:00:31.919 --> 00:00:34.410
This brings up the password
protect dialog box.

00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:39.030
So in the very first one, which is
set a password to open this document

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:43.670
and we'll just type in password,
press enter and it will ask me to

00:00:43.670 --> 00:00:47.660
enter that again and select okay.

00:00:48.680 --> 00:00:53.840
If I click okay, now that has set the
password, but that won't be active

00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:55.490
till I've actually saved the document.

00:00:55.910 --> 00:01:00.400
So if I just go to File and I'll
close the document and it will

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:01.490
ask me if I want to save it.

00:01:01.670 --> 00:01:02.750
Select yes.

00:01:03.980 --> 00:01:09.170
So now the forms letter when I open
that, it will ask for a password.

00:01:11.660 --> 00:01:12.500
Select okay.

00:01:13.670 --> 00:01:15.320
And that will then open the document.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:20.030
Another option is, is to restrict
the editing of the document.

00:01:20.220 --> 00:01:25.715
As you can see at the moment I can put my
cursor in the document and make changes.

00:01:25.715 --> 00:01:27.335
So I'll just undo those changes.

00:01:28.775 --> 00:01:31.255
So what I need to do is I
need to restrict the editing.

00:01:31.715 --> 00:01:37.035
So if I click on the tools button again,
and go down to protect document and I'll

00:01:37.065 --> 00:01:43.535
just take off the password, I will then
enter a password to modify the document.

00:01:43.535 --> 00:01:47.405
So anybody who wishes to modify
it must have the password.

00:01:50.335 --> 00:01:51.085
Click okay.

00:01:53.145 --> 00:01:56.865
Enter the password again, select OK.

00:01:58.235 --> 00:02:00.885
And again, this won't be active
until I save the documents so

00:02:00.885 --> 00:02:07.085
I'm going to go to File, Close
and then make sure I select save.

00:02:07.865 --> 00:02:12.485
So now when I click on it, it
will ask me for a password.

00:02:12.515 --> 00:02:14.795
So if I want to modify that,
I must put the password in.

00:02:14.795 --> 00:02:17.765
I can open the document, but I
would have to click read only

00:02:17.765 --> 00:02:18.935
if I didn't have the password.

00:02:19.685 --> 00:02:24.035
And then I would not be able to make
any changes no matter what I pressed.

00:02:24.935 --> 00:02:27.875
They could make a duplicate copy of
the document and make changes but the

00:02:27.875 --> 00:02:30.035
original copy would not be changed.

00:02:30.065 --> 00:02:33.665
There's no way anybody could change
that without having the actual password.

